   "financial_implications": "See report",
   "action": "Action: 13 speakers. M/S/C (Humbert/Blackaby) to adopt the first reading of Ordinance No. 8,001–N.S. from the item submitted by Councilmember Humbert including the revisions as submitted by Councilmember Blackaby in Supplemental Communications Packet #2 and further revised at the meeting as noted below. Second reading scheduled for February 10, 2026. • Paragraph numbering in Section 2.100.080 changed to A) and B) • Correct the numbering for the Severability section • The effective date is amended to be 30 days after the second reading • Remove Section 2.100.040(A)(2) • Amend Sections 2.100.050(B)(1) and 2.100.050(F)(1) to change 15 days to 12 days • Amend Section 2.100.050(C)(1) • Rename Section 2.100.050(D) • Change 30 days to 45 days in Sections 2.100.050(D)(3) and 2.100.060(B)(4) • Remove Section 2.100.070(A) Vote: Ayes – Bartlett, Tregub, O’Keefe, Blackaby, Lunaparra, Humbert, Ishii; Noes – Kesarwani, Taplin.",
